{
  "slug": "sprite-gen",
  "name": "Sprite Gen",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "Generate and manage 2D game sprites using Google Gemini's image generation. This plugin acts as a creative director — it asks about your art     \n  style, view angle, and game context before crafting an optimized prompt for Gemini. Supports single sprite generation, anchor-frame based sprite\n  sheets, and sprite management (list, delete, organize). Uses Gemini subscription via browser cookie authentication, no API key needed.",
  "longDescription": "Ships **1 skill**, `gemini-pixel-sprite-gen` (Generate chunky low-res pixel-art game sprites with consistent style across a roster (characters/monsters/bosses)).\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install sprite-gen@claude-community` from `nakzyu/sprite-gen`.\n\nA Claude Code skill for producing chunky low-res pixel-art game sprites with consistent style across an entire roster — characters, monsters, and boss variants — using Google Gemini for generation and a deterministic post-process for snap+normalize.",
